B.OL=new A.H(B.S7,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,15,10,175,19,B.Mi,"\u2022 240 ml sup\u0103 de pui cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare\n\u2022 120 ml ciuperci shiitake feliate, m\u0103surate volumetric \xeentr-un recipient gradat\n\u2022 2 linguri ghimbir proasp\u0103t tocat sau 2 linguri\u021be m\u0103cinat\n\u2022 aprox. 25 g ceap\u0103 verde tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 sos de soia cu sare redus\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei de susan, op\u021bional\n\u2022 340g file de somon, \xeemp\u0103r\u021bit \xeen 4","1. \xcentr-o tigaie ad\xe2nc\u0103 pune supa, ciupercile, ghimbirul, ceapa verde, sosul de soia \u0219i uleiul op\u021bional. Adu la fierbere, apoi fierbe domol 2\u20133 minute.\n2. Adaug\u0103 somonul \u0219i acoper\u0103 etan\u0219. G\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic 4\u20135 minute sau p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd se desface u\u0219or; sursa cere minimum 63\xb0C \xeen interior.\n3. Serve\u0219te fiecare bucat\u0103 cu 60 ml de lichid.","Garnitura de orez este separat\u0103 de varianta de baz\u0103.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/asian-style-steamed-salmon","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, soia; posibil gr\xe2u \xeen sos \u0219i susan dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti uleiul op\u021bional.","",!0,"20.10.2026","Pentru shiitake nu am confirmat un gramaj echivalent pentru felii crude. S-a p\u0103strat volumul sursei, exprimat \xeen ml, \xeen locul unui gramaj ghicit."],t.R)
