B.Oz=new A.H(B.c5,["echilibrat","Garnituri",4,5,10,39,2,B.Jk,"\u2022 20 fire medii de sparanghel, cur\u0103\u021bate\n\u2022 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie, pentru suc \u0219i coaj\u0103\n\u2022 2 linguri maionez\u0103 cu gr\u0103sime redus\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 p\u0103trunjel uscat\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 piper negru\n\u2022 1/16 linguri\u021b\u0103 sare","1. Pune aproximativ 2,5cm de ap\u0103 \xeentr-o oal\u0103 cu co\u0219 de aburi. Adaug\u0103 sparanghelul \xeen co\u0219, acoper\u0103 \u0219i adu la fierbere. Redu focul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te 5\u201310 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 intr\u0103 u\u0219or un cu\u021bit.\n2. Amestec\u0103 sucul \u0219i coaja l\u0103m\xe2ii cu maioneza, p\u0103trunjelul, piperul \u0219i sarea.\n3. Scoate sparanghelul \u0219i distribuie sosul \xeentre cele 4 por\u021bii.","Este o garnitur\u0103, nu un meniu complet.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/asparagus-lemon-sauce","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Maioneza poate con\u021bine ou \u0219i mu\u0219tar; verific\u0103 eticheta.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
