B.Oy=new A.H(B.c5,["echilibrat","Salate",4,20,10,418,21,B.KT,"\u2022 227g fusilli integrale\n\u2022 aprox. 300 g ro\u0219ii cherry, c\xe2nt\u0103rite \xeenainte de \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021bire\n\u2022 1 ardei verde mare t\u0103iat\n\u2022 aprox. 60 g ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie feliat\u0103\n\u2022 1 dovlecel mediu t\u0103iat sau ras\n\u2022 1 conserv\u0103 n\u0103ut cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare, 439g, scurs \u0219i cl\u0103tit\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 busuioc proasp\u0103t sau 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 uscat\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 piper\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei extravirgin de m\u0103sline\n\u2022 2 linguri o\u021bet balsamic\n\u2022 aprox. 50 g parmezan ras","1. Fierbe pastele conform ambalajului, aproximativ 8\u20139 minute, la limita minim\u0103 indicat\u0103. Scurge \u0219i r\u0103ce\u0219te sub ap\u0103 rece aproximativ 3 minute.\n2. Combin\u0103 legumele \u0219i n\u0103utul; asezoneaz\u0103 cu busuioc, sare \u0219i piper. Adaug\u0103 pastele reci.\n3. Amestec\u0103 uleiul cu o\u021betul \u0219i distribuie peste salat\u0103. \xcemparte \xeen 4; pune c\xe2te 2 linguri de parmezan.","Greutatea de 439g este a conservei, \xeenainte de scurgere.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/cold-fusilli-pasta-summer","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Gr\xe2u \u0219i lapte.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
B.MN=s(["cuscus","ulei","nuci","scortisoara","stafide","morcov"],t.s)
B.Ow=new A.H(B.c5,["echilibrat","Garnituri",4,5,12,218,6,B.MN,"\u2022 aprox. 175 g cu\u0219cu\u0219 uscat cu hidratare rapid\u0103, preferabil integral\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 ulei de m\u0103sline\n\u2022 aprox. 15 g nuci tocate\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 piper\n\u2022 \xbd linguri\u021b\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oar\u0103 sau amestec pumpkin spice\n\u2022 320 ml ap\u0103\n\u2022 aprox. 20 g stafide\n\u2022 aprox. 55 g morcov crud ras","1. \xcentr-o crati\u021b\u0103, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cu\u0219cu\u0219ul cu uleiul, nucile, sarea, piperul \u0219i scor\u021bi\u0219oara, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 \xeencepe s\u0103 se coloreze.\n2. Adaug\u0103 apa treptat, apoi stafidele \u0219i morcovul. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i adu la fierbere.\n3. Ia de pe foc \u0219i las\u0103 acoperit 10 minute. Af\xe2neaz\u0103 cu furculi\u021ba \u0219i serve\u0219te.","Folose\u0219te cu\u0219cu\u0219 cu hidratare rapid\u0103; verific\u0103 \u0219i instruc\u021biunile ambalajului.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/couscous-carrots-walnuts-and","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Gr\xe2u \u0219i nuci.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
