B.Oo=new A.H(B.RX,["clasic","Fel Principal","Iuliana Sb\xeernea / Bucate Aromate","https://bucate-aromate.ro/2021/06/paste-cu-ton-rosii-cherry-si-parmezan/","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.IF,"\u2022 90 g paste\n\u2022 1 conserv\u0103 de ton m\u0103run\u021bit de 170 g, scurs\u0103\n\u2022 3 linguri ulei de m\u0103sline\n\u2022 2 c\u0103\u021bei de usturoi\n\u2022 200 g ro\u0219ii cherry\n\u2022 2 linguri parmezan ras\n\u2022 Sare, piper, oregano, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel proasp\u0103t la final\n\u2022 Aproximativ 1 litru ap\u0103 \u0219i 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 sare pentru fierbere","1. Fierbe pastele \xeen apa cu sare, cu dou\u0103 minute mai pu\u021bin dec\xe2t scrie pe ambalaj. P\u0103streaz\u0103 un polonic din ap\u0103.\n2. \xcen paralel, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul cu usturoiul tocat \u0219i ro\u0219iile \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021bite. Asezoneaz\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te aproximativ 5\u20137 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 las\u0103 sos.\n3. Adaug\u0103 tonul scurs, oregano \u0219i apa p\u0103strat\u0103. Pune pastele scurse \u0219i amestec\u0103 la foc mic \xeenc\u0103 2 minute.\n4. Opre\u0219te focul, adaug\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul \u0219i serve\u0219te cu parmezan.","Sursa declar\u0103 15 minute \xeen total pentru o por\u021bie. Nu sunt afi\u0219ate valori nutri\u021bionale neverificate pentru aceast\u0103 variant\u0103.","Pe\u0219te, gr\xe2u \u0219i lapte.",!0,1,15,!1,B.Km],t.R)
